OL,3,GNorth West
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FDry with
OL,6,Fclear spells this evening, before
OL,7,Fheavy rain sweeps across the region
OL,8,Fovernight, accompanied by strong winds
OL,9,Ffor a time. Remaining mild for late
OL,10,FSeptember.
OL,11,
OL,12,CWednesday:FA wet start, with difficult
OL,13,Ftravelling conditions in places. The
OL,14,Frain will clear throughout the
OL,15,Fmorning, with a mix of sunny spells
OL,16,Fand the odd shower following. Winds
OL,17,Falso easing.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
