OL,3,GNorth West
OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Thursday to Saturday:
OL,6,FLargely dry with sunny spells
OL,7,FThursday, before rain arrives Friday.
OL,8,FDrier and brighter Saturday once early
OL,9,Fmist and fog clears. Temperatures
OL,10,Freturning nearer to average for early
OL,11,FOctober.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
